<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">2 Peter</book>
  <para style="h">2 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Peter</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Peter</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu Khris’ nasem le sawltahpi ahi Simeon Peter in, i Pa Pasien le hundampa Jesu Khris’ dihna tungtawnin kote’ upna za ma a ngasa mite tungah lai kang hlah hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasien le i Topa Jesu’ thu na theina ziehun note tungah hepina le lungmuonna a kicingin hing tung semsem taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama’ minthanna le a hoinate tawh eite ei hlan, ama i theina tungtawnin i nuntah thei nading le Pasien’ mi i hi thei nadingin ama’ Pasien vanglietna in eite kisapna zosie ei pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua bangin ama in eite tungah a manpha le a thupi mama kamciemte ei pie zo a, tua kamciemte tungtawnin lunggulna hang tawh leitunga om kisietnate panin note suohta-in Pasien’ pienzie a neite na suoh ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tami thu zieh ma-in hanciem thei tawpin na upna uh hoina tawh belap unlen, hoina pen thu theina,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />thu theina pen ki-uhzawhna, ki-uhzawhna pen thuohzawhna, thuoh zawhna pen Pasien’ mi hina,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pasien’ mi hina pen khatlekhat ki-itna, khatlekhat ki-itna pen itna tawh na belap un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tami nate pen nomau-a’ hi a, note lahah tamte ang khan semsem leh i Topa Jesu Khris’ theitelna-ah kimanna nei lona le a ga galonate panin ang kem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen tami nate a nei lo poma muna tom le mittaw hi a, a mawna luite pana a kisiensah zo lam a mangngil ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin sanggamte aw, note ang kihlatna le ang kiteelna a kip nading na hakat semsem un, azieh pen tam banga na bawl uleh na pua ngai sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tam bang ziehin i Topa le i Hundam pa uh Jesu Khris’ tawntung gam sungah lut thei nading thu a kicing tahin note ang kipie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin note in na theisa ule na kung vua ang tungsa thuman thutah sungah a kip a khosa hinan locin, tam thute ang phawhsah kiakia sawm ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tami pumpi sunga ka op laisie, tam thute kang phawsahkia ding pen thuman hi, ci-in ka ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima tungah i Topa Jesu Khris in teltahin ei lahsa ma bangin ka sina ding ang tung bai ta ding hi, ci ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei ka peikhiet zaw ciengin note in tam thute na phawh den thei nadingun ka hi thei tawpin ka hanciem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile na kung vuah i Topa Jesu Khris’ vanglietna le ang peikia nading thute kang theisah lai-un, pilvai tawh a kiphuotawm tangmite’ nua po a zuite hi loin, ama’ thupina mit tawh a mute ka hizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Vanglien Minthang Pa in, “Tam pen ka it ka tapa ahi hi, ama tungah ka lung a kim mama hi,” ci-in tua aw a gin lai-in ama in Pa Pasien tung panin patawina le minthanna a sang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama tawh muol siengtho tungah ka opton laitahun koma mama in vantung pana ang pei tami awging ka za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n kote in a kipzaw lai ahi kamsangte’ thugen ka nei uhi. Na lungsim sung vuah zingsol hing suohin khuo ang va masangin khuomiel lahah meivah tang bangin tam thute thupi sim locin hoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A masa penin note in na tel ding uh thu in: Lai Siengtho sunga genkholna thu poma mi khat guoh’ dei banga lekhiet thei hi lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile genkholna khat zong mihing’ deina tawh a pieng ngai sih a, Hlagau Siengtho’ sawlna tawh numei pasal in Pasien kung pana ang pei thute a gen uh ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hizongle mite lahah kamsang zuoute a na op bang tehtehin note lahah zong sie zuoute ang om ding a, amate in sietna a piengsah thei ngaisutnate ang dap lutpi ding uhi. Amate a lei pa ahi a pupa nangawn a niel ding vua, amate mama in thakhatin sietna a thuohlaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua bang hinanle zong mi tampite in amau’ thangtatna lampite ma zui-in tami siete ziehin thuman thutah lampi kigensie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A huoiham seng ziehun amate in zuouthu genna tawh note sum suina-in ang nei ding uhi. Amate tungah mawsahna thukhenna in tanglai-a kipan uoikai loin, a kisuhsiet nading uh zong haitu lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen vantungmite a maw ciengin Pasien in dawm vawt loin hell sungah khiesuh a, thukhen ni donga kep dingin khuomiel dum thuhpi sungah na khumcip ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ama in tanglai leitung zong dawm tuon loin Pasien a zatah lo mite tungah tuizin tungsah napi in, dihna thu a tangko Noah le adang mi sagite hunkhie veve ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sodom le Gomorrah khuote mawsahin vut le vai a suo dongin haltum a, a maimang dingin amate tungah mawsahna thukhenin, Pasien’ mi lote tungah a pieng ding thute etsahna suohsah ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ama in thukham palsatin thangtatnate in a lunggimsah midih pa Lot na hunkhie ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />(azieh pen amate lahah tua midih pa teng a, ama in amau’ gamtat sietnate nisimin mu-in za den ahi ziehin tuate in a dih mama ama’ lungsim a gimsah hi),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tua ciengin Topa in hahsatna panin midihte hutkhiet ding dan le thukhen ni dongin midih lote gawt kawmin a kep dan ding thei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a deudeu-in cilesa lunggulna lama kipie mite le thuneite a simmawte a gawt dan ding a thei hi. Amate hangsanin mot lungkhau-in minthanna a neite a gensie ngam giap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate sangin vantung mite hatzaw-in vanglienzaw nan ule, Topa mai-ah amate gensie-in mawsahna thu a tut sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanle tam mite ahile mat ding le tha ding bepa ang suoh ngaisutna nei lo ganhing maimaite tawh a kibang ahi uhi. Amate in a thei lo uh thute a gensie vua, tua ganhingte a kisuhsiet ciengin amate zong kisusie ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a tatkhielna ziehun dan a thuoh ding uhi. Amate in sun tanglaipi-a thangtat guolnopna pen nopsahna-in a ngaisun uhi. Amate in note tawh pawi a bawl ciengun a thanghuoi guolnopna uh pen note adingin a niehbang le mawsahna ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amau’ mitte in angkawm nopna tawh kidimin mawna bawl ding a cim thei sih uhi. Amate in mawna bawl dingin lungsim kip lo mite zawlin, huoihamna lamah a kicilsa lungtang a nei uhi. Samsiet tate ahi uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lampi tang nuasie-in a pielmang ta vua, sil hoi lo gamtatna thaman a deigaw Bosor’ tapa Balaam lampi a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hizongle a tawnkhielna ziehin ama na kiphawhsie a, a ham thei lo laa khat, mihing’ aw tawh hamin kamsang pa mottatna a khawlsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam bang mite pen a kanggawsa ciatui le huipi in a semmang meiilum bang ahi uhi; amate adingin khuomiel thuhpi a kikoipieh zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a mot ziehun a kiphatsah ham vua, tuaci’n amate in a tahsa thangtat lunggulnate utawh khielna sunga a nungta mite sung panin a suohta cil mite a zawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate mama zong sietna’ sila hi napi mite tungah suotahna thu a kamciem na lai uhi; bang ding ahei cile mite pen amate a zo na khatpopo’ sila a suoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Azieh pen i Topa le Hundampa Jesu Khris theina tungtawnin leitung’ buanate panin a suotah zaw ciengun tuate sungah awhin a kizawsahkia ngeingei uleh, amau’ pienzie nukhia pen in a pienzie masa pen uh sangin a siehuoizaw a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile dihna lampi a thei zaw ciengun, amate tungah a kipie a siengtho thupieh panin a kilekia uh sangin tua lampi a na thei ngai mawng lo uh hi leh, amate adingin hoizaw tham ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A man paunah in a na gen dung zui-in, “Ui in a luoh nekia,” a ci le, “A kisilsiengsa vohpi buon lahah buolkia,” ci thu amate tungah a pieng hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka itte aw, na kung vuah tami kang laihah pen a ni veina ahi ta hi; tua gel sungah na ngaisutna siengtho uh hing phawhsahkia-in ang hantawh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua pen nidang lai-a kamsang siengthote’ gen thute le na sawltahpite uh tungtawna Topa le Hunpa in a gen thupiehte na phawkia nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amasa penin note in na thei ding uh thu in, ni nukhia hun ciengin mi simmaw hatte ang pieng ding a, a cilesa deina uh bangin gamta-in mi a simmaw ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ama ang peikia nading thuciemna hei sungah om ahei? Azieh pen amate in i pu i pate si zaw a kipanin sil bangkim a kipiensah cila bangin kizom toto lai hi!” ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tangtawng lai-in Pasien’ kammal tawh vantungte na om a, tui lah panin tui tawh leitung kibawl ahi lam a thei gegu pi uh theimaw a kipang vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tua tuite tungtawnin khum hun lai-a leitung zong tuizin tungsahin kisusie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hizongle tua Pasien’ thu ma tawh tulai taha a om van le lei pen mei tawh haltum dinga kikoikhol ahi a, Pasien’ thu mang lote thukhenna hun ding le a kisuhsiet ding hun donga kikemcing ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin ka itte aw, tami thu khat na nelsie sih un. Topa adingin ni khat pen kum tulkhat tawh kibang a, kum tulkhat pen ni khat tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi pawlkhatte in kiheh a sah bangun a thuciemna-ah Topa a kiheh vawt sih hi. Ama in koima khat beh a kisiet ding dei loin mi zosie a kisiakia ding a dei ziehin note ang thuoh kenkon ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hizongle guta bangin Topa’ ni ang tung ding a, tua ciengin a gin ngai mama aw tawh vante mangthai-in, mei in vantung nate katumin zungmang ding a, tuaci’n leitung le a sunga om na zosie katum sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tam nate zosie tam bang danin zungmang sieng ding ahi ziehin, meikuong in vanpi hulin zungmang ding a, mei tawh vantung nate a tui suo ding hun ahi Pasien’ ni ang tung bai ta ding hi, ci-in note in lawp tahin lamen kawmin, a siengtho hinkhuo le Pasien’ mi hina lamah a nungta dingin bangci bang mi na hi ding uh kilawm ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin eite i hi leh ama’ ei kamciem dung zui-in dihna a opna mun van thate le lei tha lamenin i om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ka itte aw, tam thute lamenin na op laitahun, ama in note a nieh bang lo le muhkaw om loin lungmuong taha na op lam uh ang tuo nadingin na hanciem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa’ thuohzawhna pen hutdamna-in na ngaisun ta un. Tua ma bangin zong i it mama uh sanggampa Paul in ama tunga kipie pilna tawh kizui-in, na tung vuoh lai ang hlah zo ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a laihlah zosie-ah tami thu a gen hi. Tua a laihlahte sungah a telha thu tampi om a, thu thei lote le lungsim kip lote in a kisiet na bep dingun Lai Siengtho dangte a lekaih bangun tuate zong a lekaih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin no kang itte aw, note ang kimahil zo ta ahi ziehin thukham palsatte’ khielna in hing puimangin na bulkip uh na hlasuo khah lo nadingun na kidawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hizongle i Topa le Hundampa Jesu Khris’ hepina le theina-ah na khangto un. Ama tungah tu le a tawntungin minthanna om den taheh. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
